    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.25_sheaf_gluing.chapters.01_sheaf_basics_local_sections.sections.02_presheaf_of_typed_sections.concrete_anchor_6#restrictionofsection" .
silm:instances_papers_25_sheaf_gluing_chapters_01_sheaf_basics_local_sections_sections_02_presheaf_of_typed_sections_concrete_anchor_6#restrictionofsection silm:hasLongDescription "The RestrictionOfSection is the result of cropping a section s to the smaller open U_i along an open-inclusion. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 's|_{U_i}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
